{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b5d21ae3-ba7c-8861-adb2-6bb038e5365d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:55:12-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Janice Thurston",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:51:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:51:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I'm calling about a manhole cover on my street. I've been meaning to call all week and I keep forgetting, and then it clangs again and I'm like, okay, today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:51:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, what's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:51:54-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's sunk down. Like the whole cover is lower than the road around it, and every single time a car goes over it, it rings. Bang, bang. Buses, delivery trucks, all of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:52:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Where is this? What's the address or nearest one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:52:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of 169 Dixon Street. In the North End. I live in the building there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:52:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "169 Dixon. And how big is the cover, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:52:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, about two feet across? Maybe a little more. It's the round kind, you know, the iron one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:52:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And is it in the travel lane or off to the side by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:52:40-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in the lane. Cars can't really miss it unless they swerve, and my neighbor said they've seen people swerve. She said, it's gonna take somebody's tire out, and then I said, well, I'm gonna call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:52:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Smart. Is the cover sitting loose, or is it just sunk below the pavement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:53:01-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just sunk, I think. It doesn't shift or anything. It just drops when you drive over, and then that noise. I can hear it in my bedroom at like six in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:53:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'd drive me nuts too. I'll put in a work request so a crew can go look at it. They'll check whether the frame needs resetting or the pavement around it needs work."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:53:27-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Because I talked to my landlord and he said, that's the city's, not mine. And I said, well, who do I even call, and he said, just call Public Works. So here I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:53:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, he's right, a manhole in the street is ours. Or it could be a utility cover, and if so we'll pass it along to them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:53:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Okay, I didn't think about that. Whatever, as long as somebody fixes it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:53:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a callback number on the request, in case somebody needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:54:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0182."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:54:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-two. Perfect. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:54:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Janice Thurston. T-H-U-R-S-T-O-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:54:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Janice. All set, it's entered."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:54:16-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I get a reference number? Because last time I called about something, a different thing, I had nothing to point to, and they said, we have no record, and I said, I literally called you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:54:30-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, hang on, let me pull it up. [pause] Okay, it's the request number ending in four-four-seven-one. I'll read the whole thing to you slowly if you want to write it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:54:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hold on, let me grab a pen. Okay, go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:54:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "PW, one-two-one-one, dash, oh-nine-two, dash, four-four-seven-one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:54:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "PW, twelve eleven, oh-nine-two, four-four-seven-one. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:54:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. If you call back, give them that and they can find it right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:55:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks. Hopefully it's not another week of the clanging."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:55:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll flag it for the crew. Take care, Janice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:55:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
